{"ticker":"AVADHSUGAR","symbol":"AVADHSUGAR","instrumentId":3152177,"name":"Avadh Sugar & Energy","industry":"NSE-Food-Packaged","about":"Avadh Sugar & Energy Ltd. is a leading player in the sugar and renewable energy sectors, specializing in the production of sugar, ethanol, and power. The company operates multiple sugar mills and distilleries across India, using sustainable agro-industrial practices to produce high-quality sugar and ethanol. In addition to its core sugar business, Avadh Sugar generates renewable energy from bagasse, a byproduct of sugarcane processing, contributing to India’s energy needs. The company serves both domestic and international markets, supplying essential products for the food, beverage, and energy industries. Avadh Sugar is committed to sustainability and innovation, driving growth in the agro-industrial sector.","website":"www.birla-sugar.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:05:37.949Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":850.95,"changePct":5.081501605334663,"week52High":998.2,"week52Low":311.25},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,703 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,740 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"8,007,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"48"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"517,805"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.18%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.51"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"29.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.37"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.47"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-11%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"20.62"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"7–23"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"5.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"78.71"},{"label":"Volume","value":"42,460"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"142,937"},{"label":"Master score","value":"71"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"71"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"95"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"122"},{"label":